  "body": "Welcome to 9 Tautoru Avenue, Orewa — a rare opportunity to secure a generous 644sqm gentle sloping section in one of the Hibiscus Coast’s most sought after neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nThis superb site offers the perfect canvas for your dream home. With its gentle contour, construction will be easier and more cost effective, giving you the freedom to design a residence that takes full advantage of the sunshine, sea breezes and stunning coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nYou’ll love the unbeatable location — just minutes to the golden sands of Orewa Beach for morning swims or evening strolls and a short drive to Silverdale Mall for shopping, dining and daily conveniences. Easy motorway access means a quick commute to the city, while nearby schools, parks and leisure facilities make this the ideal spot for families, retirees or investors.\r\n\r\nSections of this size and quality are increasingly rare in Orewa, so act quickly. Whether you envision a modern architectural statement, a classic coastal retreat or a spacious family haven, this section provides the space and location to make it happen.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss out — secure your slice of Orewa today!",
